{"sections":[{"slug":"结合代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"结合代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"结合代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">又叫</span> $\\mathbb E_1$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-代数","text":"$A_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">是若干元素可以</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">有序</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">地结合起来的结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">给定</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个元素的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">有序</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">组</span> $(x_1,\\cdots,x_n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">仅有</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">唯一</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的方式将它们结合起来</span> $x_1\\cdots x_n$, <span lang=\"zh\">即结合的最终结果</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">与加括号的方式无关</span>”.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在结合代数的结构之上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可以考虑</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数中的结合代数</span>” ("},{"Local":{"url":"/E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"), “<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数中的结合代数中的结合代数</span>” ($\\mathbb E_3$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>), …, <span lang=\"zh\">以至于无穷</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在无穷处</span>, $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数就是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用算畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数可定义为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">参见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用语法范畴</span></h3>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">积幺半范畴</span></h4>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特殊情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结合代数是幺半群的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为有限生成自由幺半群的范畴的对偶</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为有限集</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $\\{x_1,\\cdots,x_n\\}\\to \\{y_1,\\cdots,y_m\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为形如</span> $y_i = f_i(x_1,\\cdots,x_n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的变量代换</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每个</span> $f_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">为幺半群的理论中的公式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\{x_1,\\cdots,x_n\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/列表","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">列表</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">等价地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个态射是</span> $\\{y_1,\\cdots,y_m\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\{x_1,\\cdots,x_n\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成的自由幺半群的一个集合映射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">那么</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的结合代数即是上述范畴到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的保持有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.</p>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">一般幺半范畴</span></h4>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结合代数可由如下</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为有限全序集</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">包括空集</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其态射为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/偏序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏序集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">幺半结构为</span>$$\r\n\\{a_1 &lt; \\cdots &lt; a_n\\} \\otimes \\{b_1 &lt; \\cdots &lt; b_m\\} = \\{a_1 &lt; \\cdots &lt; a_n &lt; b_1 &lt; \\cdots &lt; b_m\\}.\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">注意这个幺半结构</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不是</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半结构</span>, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">不存在</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">自然同构</span> $A\\otimes B\\simeq B\\otimes A$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">该幺半范畴的底层范畴就是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_+$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中的单点集是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的结合代数</span>.</p>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span></h4>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结合代数可由如下</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为有限集</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个集合映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备每个点的原像</span> $f^{-1}(y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全序</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半结构为无交并</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这个范畴是一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/PROP","text":"PROP"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">具体表现</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的结合代数有很具体的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-代数","text":"$A_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}